{"a":[89,90],"h":"<p>88.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"243\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 242.7 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 16.4 27.0 27.0 33.7 40.4 47.2 47.2 63.0 73.4 80.2 80.2 87.0 87.0 93.7 100.4 107.2 107.2 116.2 116.2 123.7 139.4 150.7 150.7 166.4 166.4 175.4 175.4 187.4 204.0 210.7 219.7\" y=\"25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"33.7 40.4 63.0 100.4 187.4 210.7 219.7 226.4\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> İmdi şefaati hasene sevab, şefaati seyyie vebal, Allaha hısab vermek muhakkak, Allah bir, kıyamet gününde şübhe yok iken siz o Münafıklar hakkında neye iki fırka oluyorsunuz?<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"219\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 218.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 23.3 31.6 31.6 50.3 70.6 77.3 86.3 86.3 102.0 102.0 111.0 111.0 131.3 142.6 142.6 150.7 166.6 166.6 173.3 173.3 173.3 180.0 187.6 194.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"38.3 38.3 50.3 77.3 119.3 119.3 131.3 150.7 194.3 202.6\" y=\"25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> halbuki Allah onları kesbettikleri küfrü maasî sebebile terslerine çevirib reddetmiştir. <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"265\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 265.3 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 23.3 23.3 23.3 30.0 37.6 53.3 53.3 63.7 77.3 93.0 93.0 103.6 119.3 126.0 134.3 134.3 143.3 143.3 151.6 167.3 167.3 177.7 193.6 204.0 212.3 212.3 221.3 228.0 228.0 235.6 235.6 242.3\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 20.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\">