iewBox=\"0 0 218.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 16.6 25.6 25.6 34.6 42.7 42.7 51.7 51.7 58.6 58.6 67.6 79.6 96.7 96.7 113.3 113.3 120.0 141.0 141.0 150.0 150.0 159.0 167.3 167.3 174.0 174.0 180.7 180.7 187.6 194.3\" y=\"26.3 26.3 26.3 21.0 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"67.6 79.6 120.0 194.3 202.6\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve bulduğunuz yerde, ya'ni Haremi şerîf içinde de olsa kendilerini katlediniz<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"271\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 270.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 23.3 23.3 23.3 30.7 37.6 37.6 51.7 67.6 79.6 96.7 103.6 103.6 103.6 110.3 110.3 117.7 135.0 135.0 144.0 144.0 152.3 152.3 159.0 159.0 174.7 181.6 189.7 189.7 198.7 198.7 211.6 211.6 218.3 234.0 246.0\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 26.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"51.7 72.0 79.6 117.7 211.6 218.3 238.6 246.0 254.3\" y=\"25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6 20.3 25.6 25.6 25.6 25.6\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ve bunlardan ne bir dost ne bir yardımcı tutmayınız, külliyyen ictinab ediniz 90.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"101\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 101.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 27.0 33.7 33.7 42.7 42.7 50.2 66.0 70.4 78.0 78.0\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 42.7 70.4 84.7\" y=\"25.4 20.3 20.3 25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ancak şu iki halin birinde bulunanlar ahz-u katilden müstesnadır.</p><p>1-<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"298\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 297.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 28.6 3